B.Ul=new A.aE("Dry Skin","Restores HP from Water moves and Rain; takes extra damage from Fire and Sun.")
B.SX=new A.aE("Early Bird","The Pok\xe9mon awakens twice as fast as other Pok\xe9mon from sleep.")
